1
00:01:23,920 --> 00:01:24,980
Tiansheng Yiqing.

2
00:01:27,720 --> 00:01:28,580
Sixth Brother.

3
00:01:29,080 --> 00:01:31,210
I don't think Father wanted to do this,

4
00:01:31,600 --> 00:01:34,400
but you really overstepped your bounds this time.

5
00:01:34,680 --> 00:01:35,920
So he had to postpone

6
00:01:35,920 --> 00:01:37,520
your investiture ceremony.

7
00:02:02,960 --> 00:02:04,820
Is there anything else, Brother?

8
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:08,370
I need to take Princess Xiyao back to get married.

9
00:02:10,960 --> 00:02:13,520
You taking Princess Xiyao back to get married,

10
00:02:13,520 --> 00:02:15,180
what does it have to do with me?

11
00:02:15,640 --> 00:02:16,640
Fine.

12
00:02:18,560 --> 00:02:20,820
If you don't admit she is Princess Xiyao,

13
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:22,680
I won't take what you love.

14
00:02:24,520 --> 00:02:26,380
But Father granted the marriage,

15
00:02:26,560 --> 00:02:29,490
and it concerns the peace between the two countries.

16
00:02:29,560 --> 00:02:31,360
Point me in the right direction.

17
00:02:31,680 --> 00:02:32,800
What should I do?

18
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:36,480
If you insist on taking her back,

19
00:02:37,880 --> 00:02:38,800
why don't you

20
00:02:40,160 --> 00:02:41,920
step over my dead body?

21
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:48,329
Don't worry, Prince Yu.

22
00:02:51,920 --> 00:02:53,250
Princess Xiyao is here.

23
00:02:56,200 --> 00:02:57,360
The princess is really

24
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:58,560
resourceful.

25
00:03:00,520 --> 00:03:02,480
Since the misunderstanding has been cleared up,

26
00:03:02,480 --> 00:03:03,720
please, Prince Yu,

27
00:03:03,720 --> 00:03:05,440
take Princess Xiyao back.

28
00:03:07,600 --> 00:03:08,560
What Guli said,

29
00:03:09,080 --> 00:03:10,360
I understand.

30
00:03:13,320 --> 00:03:14,440
But why is Mr. Su

31
00:03:15,200 --> 00:03:17,880
with my fiancée?

32
00:03:21,720 --> 00:03:22,920
I was just traveling

33
00:03:22,920 --> 00:03:24,720
and happened to save Princess Xiyao.

34
00:03:24,720 --> 00:03:25,520
That's all.

35
00:03:27,880 --> 00:03:30,560
I finally got a day off,

36
00:03:30,760 --> 00:03:32,090
and wasted it all on you.

37
00:03:35,440 --> 00:03:38,570
You Central Plains people have such beautiful clothes.

38
00:03:38,640 --> 00:03:40,500
These are just ordinary clothes.

39
00:03:40,680 --> 00:03:42,320
There's a silk shop in the south of the city.

40
00:03:42,320 --> 00:03:44,720
The clothes there are even more beautiful.

41
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:52,930
There are thieves in your capital too.

42
00:03:52,960 --> 00:03:53,760
Yes.

43
00:03:54,160 --> 00:03:57,360
The technique is exactly the same as a certain someone's.

44
00:04:02,520 --> 00:04:03,850
You are Princess Xiyao.

45
00:04:06,560 --> 00:04:08,490
Since Mr. Su is unwilling to speak,

46
00:04:09,160 --> 00:04:11,080
I won't force you.

47
00:04:20,320 --> 00:04:21,240
Please.

48
00:04:21,519 --> 00:04:23,000
Princess Xiyao.

49
00:05:02,680 --> 00:05:04,210
Why are you being so sneaky?

50
00:05:04,440 --> 00:05:06,560
I think you're the one being sneaky.

51
00:05:08,280 --> 00:05:09,080
What's wrong?

52
00:05:10,160 --> 00:05:10,920
Alright.

53
00:05:10,920 --> 00:05:12,980
I have something to talk to you about.

54
00:05:13,880 --> 00:05:15,400
It's rare for you to be so polite.

55
00:05:15,400 --> 00:05:17,060
Then I must listen carefully.

56
00:05:18,240 --> 00:05:20,840
Didn't that maid from Rouran

57
00:05:20,840 --> 00:05:23,100
give Zhiluo a potion to erase her memory?

58
00:05:24,040 --> 00:05:26,040
Don't you know Princess Xiyao?

59
00:05:30,160 --> 00:05:30,960
Help me out.

60
00:05:33,520 --> 00:05:34,880
Doing it yourself

61
00:05:35,240 --> 00:05:36,520
shows your sincerity.

62
00:05:39,280 --> 00:05:41,000
You clearly don't even dare to see her,

63
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:43,130
yet you claim you have nothing to hide.

64
00:05:58,880 --> 00:06:00,200
So Princess Xiyao

65
00:06:02,600 --> 00:06:03,760
really said that?

66
00:06:05,080 --> 00:06:07,560
Your Highness, the Princess replied that

67
00:06:08,160 --> 00:06:09,720
as long as you agree,

68
00:06:10,640 --> 00:06:12,440
she will hand over the antidote.

69
00:06:33,560 --> 00:06:35,320
Try this.

70
00:06:36,600 --> 00:06:37,880
Thank you, Your Highness.

71
00:06:37,880 --> 00:06:39,640
I can do this myself.

72
00:06:43,680 --> 00:06:44,840
Have some too.

73
00:06:55,680 --> 00:06:57,080
Let me get you some more.

74
00:07:01,520 --> 00:07:04,120
Jingxuan, you're going to finish all the fish.

75
00:07:04,400 --> 00:07:05,360
She always chokes on fish bones.

76
00:07:05,360 --> 00:07:07,090
What's wrong with eating more?

77
00:07:11,640 --> 00:07:13,400
Come, let me propose a toast to you.

78
00:07:13,400 --> 00:07:14,660
To celebrate Jingxuan

79
00:07:14,680 --> 00:07:16,010
regaining what he lost.

80
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:19,880
Cheers.

81
00:07:36,400 --> 00:07:37,560
Try this too.

82
00:07:37,800 --> 00:07:39,159
You don't have to serve me.

83
00:07:39,159 --> 00:07:39,760
This is delicious.

84
00:07:39,760 --> 00:07:40,960
Eat more.

85
00:07:41,720 --> 00:07:42,520
Thank you.

86
00:07:49,880 --> 00:07:50,740
That's enough.

87
00:07:50,920 --> 00:07:51,980
How is this enough?

88
00:07:52,360 --> 00:07:53,400
Eat more.

89
00:07:59,680 --> 00:08:00,480
Slow down.

90
00:08:03,840 --> 00:08:06,100
Prince Shuo has done what he promised me.

91
00:08:07,200 --> 00:08:08,400
Here is the antidote.

92
00:08:14,040 --> 00:08:15,700
You are very noble, Princess.

93
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:19,240
Young Master Su will escort you back.

94
00:08:19,840 --> 00:08:21,200
I will take my leave now.

95
00:08:21,960 --> 00:08:22,760
Alright.

96
00:08:46,040 --> 00:08:47,520
I have arranged for my men

97
00:08:48,160 --> 00:08:50,200
to escort Princess Yu back to the manor.

98
00:08:50,200 --> 00:08:52,600
You used to call me Miss Aduo.

99
00:08:53,880 --> 00:08:55,610
Watch your words, Princess Yu.

100
00:08:57,280 --> 00:08:58,120
I begged you so much back then.

101
00:08:58,120 --> 00:09:00,560
Why did you insist on sending me back?

102
00:09:01,480 --> 00:09:03,360
If the Princess's escape from the marriage is exposed,

103
00:09:03,360 --> 00:09:04,920
war will inevitably break out between the Celestial Empire and Rouran.

104
00:09:04,920 --> 00:09:07,440
I don't want the people of both countries to suffer.

105
00:09:07,440 --> 00:09:08,840
You care about the world.

106
00:09:08,840 --> 00:09:09,880
You pity the people.

107
00:09:09,880 --> 00:09:11,480
But you refuse to pity me.

108
00:09:11,480 --> 00:09:12,720
Is that so, Su Zhiye?

109
00:09:22,120 --> 00:09:24,120
Forgive me, Princess Yu.

110
00:09:24,960 --> 00:09:26,800
You are so heartless.

111
00:09:27,040 --> 00:09:29,000
You are so hypocritical.

112
00:09:29,080 --> 00:09:31,400
I never want to see you again in my life.

113
00:10:06,280 --> 00:10:07,940
I forgot to ask Princess Xiyao

114
00:10:08,520 --> 00:10:11,320
how long it takes for this medicine to take effect.

115
00:10:23,600 --> 00:10:24,860
Zhiluo, you're awake.

116
00:10:26,640 --> 00:10:27,400
Are you okay?
